 "notes": "Ruinerwold sand pit (Engelgaarde): entries on the north and west sides, the three small boat wrecks, picnic table, pipes and cage by the northern steiger, loam walls around the 10-15 m basin with a 17 m hole, and the line south of which diving is not allowed (fishing water), on the OpenStreetMap shoreline; positions are approximate. The site point is the village centre, about 2 km north-east of the lake.",
